cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the TOMPEI-CMMD dataset, please cite it as listed under preferred-citation, and follow the TCIA data usage policy."
type: software
title: TOMPEI-CMMD sample code
abstract: >-
  Sample Python code to view, overlay, and inspect the TOMPEI-CMMD dataset
  published on The Cancer Imaging Archive (TCIA). TOMPEI-CMMD adds lesion
  segmentation annotations (polygon masks for benign and malignant lesions)
  and corrected laterality/view labels to the Chinese Mammography Database
  (CMMD), for developing and validating breast cancer detection AI.
